{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
In the eighteenth [Eb]year, Jeroboam [Bb]reigned
Abi[Cm]jah became king over Ju[Ab]dah
Three [Eb]years he ruled from Jerusa[Bb]lem
His mother was Maacah of Gi[Ab]beah
War broke [Cm]out between the di[Bb]vided [Ab]lands
Jeroboam rose up in rebel[Bb]lion
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
